OL,5,G0600 Sounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,6,G     Blackburn
OL,7,     FTony brings you two hours of music
OL,8,     Ffrom the best decade ever, with
OL,9,     Fhits from Andy Williams, Dionne
OL,10,     FWarwick and Brenda Lee. This week,
OL,11,     Fthe top three comes from 1965.
OL,12,G0700 Sounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,13,G     Blackburn
OL,14,     FTony celebrates the iconic artists
OL,15,     Fand songs that shaped the 1960s to
OL,16,     Fmark 'National Album Day'.
